---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
import TickerRow from '../components/TickerRow.astro';
import SectionRule from '../components/SectionRule.astro';
import PixelLink from '../components/PixelLink.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Electric Sheep — About"
  description="Meet Toby Balderson, the human behind Electric Sheep."
>
  <div class="section-grid intro">
    <SectionLabel highlight="The human behind the sheep." />
    <span class="statement"
      >Toby Balderson founded Electric Sheep in 2023 to sit at the intersection of technology and
      humanity. He designs the tools, builds the automations, and answers the emails. Usually in
      that order.</span
    >
  </div>

  <div class="rule-wrap">
    <TickerRow />
    <SectionRule />
  </div>

  <div class="portrait">
    <div class="portrait__frame">
      <img src="/assets/images/toby.jpg" alt="Toby Balderson" />
      <div class="portrait__overlay"></div>
      <span class="portrait__caption">Big nose, bigger ideas.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="What he does" />
    <span class="text-section__body"
      >Strategy, brand, UX and the plumbing behind them. If a robot can do the boring part, Toby
      will build the robot. The judgement stays human.</span
    >
  </div>

  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="Why sheep?" />
    <span class="text-section__body"
      >Do Androids dream of Electric Sheep? We don't know. But naming a studio after the question
      felt honest. Sheep by name. Not by nature.</span
    >
  </div>

  <div class="section-grid text-section">
    <SectionLabel highlight="The studio" />
    <span class="text-section__body"
      >10 Minden Street, St Helier, Jersey. Coffee is good. Toby accepts visitors by
      appointment.</span
    >
  </div>

  <div class="px-hover links">
    <PixelLink
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/toby-balderson-69b752164/"
      color="var(--text-primary)"
      fontSize={24}
    >
      Find Toby on LinkedIn
    </PixelLink>
    <PixelLink href="/contact" color="var(--text-primary)" fontSize={24}>
      Start a conversation
    </PixelLink>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .rule-wrap {
    padding: 0 var(--page-margin);
  }
  .portrait {
    padding: 24px var(--page-margin) 16px var(--page-margin);
  }
  .portrait__frame {
    position: relative;
    height: 515px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--surface-placeholder);
  }
  .portrait__frame img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .portrait__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--overlay-protect);
  }
  .portrait__caption {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--card-pad);
    bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--es-cream);
  }
  .text-section {
    padding-top: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .text-section__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--text-section-label);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .links {
    padding: var(--section-pad) var(--page-margin);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
</style>
